'''Len Town''' (Japanese: '''ブレンタウン''' ''Bren Town'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Johto]] [[region]]. It is situated between [[Azalea Town]] and [[Goldenrod City]]. It was featured in ''[[EP156|The Psychic Sidekicks!]]''.

While visiting the town, {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} met [[Cherry]] after stumbling across a mysterious Pokémon, which turned out to be Cherry's {{p|Girafarig}}. Cherry later explained that [[Ilex Forest|the forest]] that surrounds the town is known for being inhabited by {{type|Ghost}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}. As such, the townspeople have {{pkmn2|caught}} and {{pkmn|training|trained}} with exclusively {{type|Psychic}} Pokémon as a means of protection for centuries. Later, Cherry and her Girafarig helped destroy {{TRT}}'s [[Team Rocket's mechas|Gengar mecha]] and return the townspeople's stolen Pokémon.

Other known residents of Len Town include [[Mrs. Bellows]] and {{OBP|Toku|EP156}}.

