==Trivia==
* The town's trend of using Psychic-types for protection against Ghost-types should not work due to the town being introduced in [[Generation II]]. Ghost-type attacks are super effective against Psychic types starting in that generation. Only [[Cherry|one resident]] is known to actually possess a Psychic-type Pokémon ({{p|Girafarig}}) that can protect against Ghost types because of its immunity being a part {{type|Normal}}.

